Elephant experimental text-choice integration

The text prompt and answer-label order are adapted from OneJev's qev/prompt.py
at revision 81ce62f1597c91e46767d4d02d6ac2e18534fe94. The integration changes
the implementation and supports a limited text-choice path. OneJev is licensed
under Apache License 2.0; the license text is included as LICENSE.

https://github.com/OmniJev/OneJev/tree/81ce62f1597c91e46767d4d02d6ac2e18534fe94

The separately obtained Elephant checkpoint, tokenizer and generated model
assets are not included in this package. The pinned model card declares MIT
and identifies Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B as its base model:
https://huggingface.co/baselabs/elephant-1/tree/b3f8a93462fb1051a9de031e94a7ff380e254072

Review the exact model, base model and generated asset terms and notices before
distributing those assets separately.
